omly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nOn Friday afternoon, the company announces the list of outstanding employees for this month, and Xiao Li finds out that he receives this honor. Xiao Li excitedly comes to the office, sees Xiao Wang is organizing files, and happily says, \"Xiao Wang, I am selected as the outstanding employee of this month, it is really unexpected!\" Xiao Wang responds with a smile, \"Congratulations, Xiao Li. You indeed work hard.\" The manager comes over, pats Xiao Li's shoulder and says, \"Xiao Li, your performance this month is great, keep it up.\" Xiao Li turns to Xiao Wang and says, \"Actually, I think you also qualify for this honor, you always do your job well.\" Xiao Wang continues to organize the files.\n\n[Question]\nDoes anyone say something inappropriate in this story?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Someone says something inappropriate in the story.\nB. No one says anything inappropriate in the story.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00132499392152133,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e13bd6006945d27feab8","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367803519,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:30:03","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"312df622d1ef4a7497647cb17c888d97"}